<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to January.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to January.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Thursday released its preliminary monetary aggregates up to January. All figures are in billions of pesos:</p>
<p>			  Dec95   Jan96   Dec96   Jan97</p>
<p> M1		     165.4   159.7   230.8   215.5</p>
<p> Notes/coins	   60.7    52.9    74.7    70.6</p>
<p> Chequing accts     104.7   106.6   156.1   144.9</p>
<p> M4		     880.1   891.3   1,145   1,172</p>
<p>Bank deposits</p>
<p>  -private	    566.6   570.8   713.6   732.2</p>
<p>  -development	 76.5    76.5   110.8   112.6</p>
<p>Securities</p>
<p>  -government	 104.6   116.5   146.3   153.1</p>
<p>  -private	     23.2    23.3    20.7    21.0</p>
<p> Retirement savings  48.5    51.3    79.2    82.8</p>
<p>M1 measures notes and coins in circulation and chequing accounts.</p>
<p>M4 measures notes and coins in circulation as well as deposits in the banking system, holdings of private and government securities and funds in the Retirement Savings System (SAR).</p>
<p>-- Martin Langfield, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9558</p>
